  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Life; <strong>CL</strong> 2nd<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 200 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 0.1 lbs.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nMade from blessed water touched by a feather from an angelic being, this potion restores the same effects as the cleansing potion as well as completely removing the exhausted and nauseated conditions, and makes check with a +2 bonus against the DC of any poison or disease the target is suffering from, removing the poison or disease if successful.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nDistill Compound, Life sphere (Restore Health (cure)); <strong>Cost</strong> 100 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/compounds#toc21\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Reviewed selection: greater, 200 gp.</p><p>One greater blessed-water dose, not multiple doses. No conventional Restoration spell or invented save type is imported; the fixed +2 check belongs to the oil/potion effect, not the drinker's general saves.</p><p>Single-dose quantity is consumed through the native helper. Target outcomes, temporary effects and any external eligibility remain deliberate; carrying the bottle grants no persistent bonus.</p>",
      "unidentified": ""
    },
